abstract: >-
  An evidence-driven Quality Engineering framework for using AI agents to
  classify and explain automated test failures while preserving deterministic
  evidence and human ownership. The work covers Playwright artifacts,
  deterministic diagnostics, historical signatures, change correlation,
  failure taxonomy, structured AI triage, explicit uncertainty, flaky-test
  analysis, unsupported-claim validation, calibration, security and privacy,
  observability, CI/CD integration, evaluation metrics and production feedback
  into durable root-cause intelligence.